      "name": "Forager",
      "category": "interaction",
      "text": "While using Survival to Subsist, if the tracker rolls a failure or a critical failure, they get a success instead. If the tracker rolls a success, they can provide food for 16 additional creatures that eat about as much as a human, or 32 creatures on a critical success.",
